  "name": "LINE PROBE ASSAY FOR XDR-TB (SECOND LINE DRUG RESISTANCE))",
  "code": "LPA_XDR_TB",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Drug Group Tested</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Target Gene(s) on LPA</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Resistance Indicated if Mutation Detected</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Clinical Significance</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Fluoroquinolones (FQs)</strong> (e.g., Levofloxacin, Moxifloxacin, Ofloxacin)</td>\n<td><strong>gyrA, gyrB</strong></td>\n<td>Mutation = FQ resistance</td>\n<td>Confirms resistance to key second-line oral drugs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Second-line Injectable Agents (SLI)</strong> (e.g., Amikacin, Kanamycin, Capreomycin)</td>\n<td><strong>rrs, eis promoter</strong></td>\n<td>Mutation = SLI resistance</td>\n<td>Loss of effectiveness of injectable group</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>XDR-TB Confirmation</strong></td>\n<td>&ndash;</td>\n<td>Resistance to <strong>both</strong> FQs <strong>and</strong> at least <strong>one SLI</strong></td>\n<td>Defines <strong>Extensively Drug-Resistant TB (XDR-TB)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<li data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1039\">\n<p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"959\"><strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"957\">Sensitive (No mutation detected):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1039\">\n<li data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1039\">\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1039\">Wild-type bands present, no resistance mutations &rarr; drug likely effective.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1171\">\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1078\"><strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1076\">Resistant (Mutation detected):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1171\">\n<li data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1171\">\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1171\">Loss of wild-type band and/or presence of mutant band &rarr; resistance to that drug group.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1202\">Indeterminate / Invalid:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1289\">Faint, missing, or unclear bands &rarr; repeat test or confirm with another method.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "showInterpretation": true,
